				<r3d:description language="eng">This library is a public and easily accessible resource database of images, videos, and animations of cells, capturing a wide diversity of organisms, cell types, and cellular processes. The Cell Image Library has been merged with &quot;Cell Centered Database&quot; in 2017. The purpose of the database is to advance research on cellular activity, with the ultimate goal of improving human health.</r3d:description>
